        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/ea5d25/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-11T16:24:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Wager Master introduces new ways in which the heroes can win/lose the game. Those should be included in the ways that the game can end (they were not there as of last Thursday).</span></p><p>Also, there's no clear option for the heroes winning by just destroying the villain.</p>",
